北，大破之。以太僕擊胡騎平城南，三陷陳，功為多，賜所奪邑五百戶。以太僕擊陳豨、黥布軍，陷陳卻敵，益食千戶，定食汝陰六千九百戶，除前所食。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"臧荼","kind":"person","person_id":"xaa_ewn_4ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"荼","kind":"person","person_id":"xaa_ewn_4ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"楚王信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"閼氏","kind":"person","person_id":"32k_yr7_5kv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0121","start":121,"end":122,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"1xx_s1v_svn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m020-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"zxd_afr_2xg","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","book_id":"b-shiji-095","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p012","text":"是時漢初定中國，徙韓王信於代，都馬邑。匈奴大攻圍馬邑，韓王信降匈奴。匈奴得信，因引兵南踰句注，攻太原，至晉陽下。高帝自將兵往擊之。會冬大寒雨雪，卒之墮指者十二三，於是冒頓詳敗走，誘漢兵。漢兵逐擊冒頓，冒頓匿其精兵，見其羸弱，於是漢悉兵，多步兵，三十二萬，北逐之。高帝先至平城，步兵未盡到，冒頓縱精兵四十萬騎圍高帝於白登，七日，漢兵中外不得相救餉。匈奴騎，其西方盡白馬，東方盡青駹馬，北方盡烏驪馬，南方盡騂馬。高帝乃使使閒厚遺閼氏，閼氏乃謂冒頓曰：「兩主不相困。今得漢地，而單于終非能居之也。且漢王亦有神，單于察之。」冒頓與韓王信之將王黃、趙利期，而黃、利兵又不來，疑其與漢有謀，亦取閼氏之言，乃解圍之一角。於是高帝令士皆持滿傅矢外鄉，從解角直出，竟與大軍合，而冒頓遂引兵而去。漢亦引兵而罷，使劉敬結和親之約。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"韓王信","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"韓王信","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m012-0131","sta